  "sourceTitle": "Should you let JEV make all of your decisions?",
  "sourceBodyHash": "907fb1021a8d91502c144d88acdff280dd812540fb8eaa3a6528e394762f4ecb",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T02:12:19.249399Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T02:28:49.085190Z",
  "totalBlocks": 15,
  "translatedBlocks": 15,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e6b1b68f333a2ac",
      "translationZh": "看到 JEV 时，我首先想到的是：它速度快、成本低，但不可能像前沿模型那样准确。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbb6233a3b5872e5",
      "translationZh": "于是，我设计了一个基准测试来验证这个假设。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bd2187dfd0190ca",
      "translationZh": "我在相同的限定决策契约下评估了 JEV 和我们使用的几种常规 LLM：状态、评分标准、允许的答案以及标准答案标签都相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e167641aeb335b23",
      "translationZh": "最初几轮测试表明，JEV 是否是一个好的选择，在很大程度上取决于决策类型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "166e2ffe0aa011c3",
      "translationZh": "任务 JEV 测得的最佳结果 我的推断",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e30fe14bc0d9c787",
      "translationZh": "如果路由错误的代价高昂，就不应让 JEV 成为唯一的决策依据。将不确定的案例交给在你自己的验证中表现最好的模型，或转交审核。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e72c3fd311b98ff0",
      "translationZh": "策略 / 护栏决策",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16781d20dab0fd94",
      "translationZh": "在这类任务上，JEV 的质量接近测得的最佳水平，p50 延迟为 234 ms，而其他受测路由的延迟为 716–1,735 ms。这对于范围明确、处理量大的决策来说很有前景——前提是你自己的策略和数据验证了这一点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "851484e1b2e9a01e",
      "translationZh": "搜索相关性评分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71905bab21bfc00b",
      "translationZh": "JEV 和 Claude Sonnet 5：47.4%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbba7c06705f0c0c",
      "translationZh": "在这次测评快照中，JEV 达到了测得的最高准确率，而且比 Sonnet 快得多（239 ms 对比 2,047 ms）。但 47.4% 的结果不足以让我将其用于会产生重大影响的自主排序；它更适合作为检索/重排序流程中的一个组件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c7637ca18b001c2",
      "translationZh": "额外发现：运行可靠性（响应一致性）结果比准确率更有意思。对于所有接受测评的任务契约，JEV 都生成了有效的原生有界输出，比例为 100%。在相关性评分中，它报告的分数与其概率分布在 100% 的情况下都一致；而几个接受测试的 LLM 调用路径则出现了严重的一致性问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71db283e3164c773",
      "translationZh": "所以，如果你需要评分明细，目前 JEV 是唯一可靠的模型（我认为其他前沿实验室可能很快也会添加决策接口/API）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fb64a5bbaaa796f",
      "translationZh": "我对 JEV 的更多用例特别感兴趣。如果你有某个工作流程可能适合使用 JEV，请分享给我——我可以添加有代表性的任务，并将它与其他前沿模型进行基准比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad1ae28310c5d2aa",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/tenkei_01 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
